he kids is second to none! The noise canceling leaves a bit to be desired; the comfort is great but I don't think the seal is tight enough for me to get the best NC performance; bigger eartips are too big and the medium ones don't seal well enough for strong ANC. Battery life is top tier and I never experience connection issues either; great connectivity with all my Galaxy and non-Galaxy devices. Nevertheless, a fantastic pair of headphones both in terms of sound and design. I wish the pinch controls worked a bit better too.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"AliAdnaanRaza"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/0f41296f-951f-5aec-baef-4d37643c96a9","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/0f41296f-951f-5aec-baef-4d37643c96a9"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/b538a4e7-f7f1-5a56-ba89-89704b5e39d0","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/b538a4e7-f7f1-5a56-ba89-89704b5e39d0"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/6bceb9c6-77c8-5132-8af1-4f4c2982edb0","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/6bceb9c6-77c8-5132-8af1-4f4c2982edb0"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/10b1479e-d449-593d-9ed6-60c8e3a19b5b","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/10b1479e-d449-593d-9ed6-60c8e3a19b5b"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/ddbbe8af-57fc-5ee2-bf41-c8fc1dd85d82","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/ddbbe8af-57fc-5ee2-bf41-c8fc1dd85d82"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/8c18d41a-d8d7-5262-8cda-786aafd0952b","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/8c18d41a-d8d7-5262-8cda-786aafd0952b"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-03-26T08:51:09.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-05-05T01:35:44.000+00:00","headline":"Galaxy Buds4 Pro: A Solid, If Familiar, Step Forwa","reviewBody":"I finally got my hands on the Galaxy Buds4 Pro on March 19th. Given the current regional tensions here in the UAE, I was honestly impressed that the delivery made it through without a hitch—major props to the logistics team for keeping things moving.\n\n​The Design: A Much-Needed Refinement\n​The first thing that stands out is the new design. Samsung has refined the \"blade\" aesthetic from the previous generation, and the new flat stem is a massive win. It feels much more premium and, more importantly, it’s actually functional. The tactile feedback when pinching or swiping for volume is far more intuitive than the more angular stems on the Buds3 Pro. It’s a sleeker, more intentional look that feels right at home in 2026.\n​\nAudio & Performance\n​Sound-wise, there is a noticeable audio upgrade, largely thanks to the refined driver system. The \"super wide\" woofer provides a tighter, more punchy bass that doesn't muddy the mids. It’s not a night-and-day difference, but for anyone who appreciates clarity and a wider soundstage, the improvement is definitely there. The ANC also feels a bit \"smarter\" at filtering out specific ambient frequencies, which is a nice touch.\n\n​The Reality Check\n​If there’s a \"minus\" to be found, it’s that this feels like an iterative upgrade. If you’re coming from the Buds3 Pro, the jump isn't massive. Most of the core features remain similar, and while the tweaks are welcome, it’s more of a \"Pro 1.5\" than a total revolution in earbud technology.\n\n​Final Verdict:\nDespite the incremental nature of the internal upgrades, I’m really happy with these. The design alone makes them feel like a fresh start, and the slight audio bump makes the listening experience just that much better.\n\n​Realistic Commentary:\nHonestly, I spent half the morning just swiping the new stems because they actually work now. It’s a relief to have them arrive on time despite everything going on—nothing says \"modern living\" like tracking a high-tech delivery while the world is in a bit of a mood.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Noranaito"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/6e95a35b-f9e3-5fe4-ade6-bd199903c21e","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/6e95a35b-f9e3-5fe4-ade6-bd199903c21e"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/bce6f578-dd4d-5c4b-aee4-9fdc4a7e0418","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/bce6f578-dd4d-5c4b-aee4-9fdc4a7e0418"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/f3ac03a3-86a9-5cda-a23e-bb7c90892240","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/f3ac03a3-86a9-5cda-a23e-bb7c90892240"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/3537c267-0046-5f5a-9b22-3187e55d5c87","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/3537c267-0046-5f5a-9b22-3187e55d5c87"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/ac8febe4-e464-5812-9b32-ba20e1dfa39b","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/ac8febe4-e464-5812-9b32-ba20e1dfa39b"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-04-21T17:05:17.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-04-22T01:45:14.000+00:00","headline":"Best earbuds yet","reviewBody":"I’ve been using the Galaxy Buds 4 Pro for a few weeks. I got them as a gift, and I would say they are nothing short of exceptional. The noise cancellation is the main point since I have online meetings and stuff, and it makes sure I never hear anything distracting. I would honestly compare it to top-tier headphones. I barely even hear anything when I’m walking through a real street, and you know how noisy it gets because of traffic.\n\nAs for connectivity, it is seamless. They appear instantly on my phone and my tablet. My tablet is a Tab S10 Ultra, and my phone is an S25 Ultra. Battery life is really solid. I get about 7 to 8 hours on a single charge, and the case holds plenty more.\n\nThe sound is just chef’s kiss. The vocals are very crisp, and the bass hits just right, so it’s not too boomy and not too light. Comfort is also really good. My Buds 2 Pro used to hurt my ears after about 3 to 4 hours, but these I can easily use for around 7 hours without any discomfort.\n\nThey also have ambient sound mode, which I would say is really needed since it helps me stay aware of my surroundings without being too noisy.\n\nOverall, I would say these are premium earbuds and truly the best in every category. I couldn’t recommend them more.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"msa910"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/5f12ef5c-a223-5d62-8569-35411a2770e7","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/5f12ef5c-a223-5d62-8569-35411a2770e7"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/446f3ba5-a879-5234-94ec-5acbfe120051","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/446f3ba5-a879-5234-94ec-5acbfe120051"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/021caddc-77e1-58ed-a0cc-63985a4f0496","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/021caddc-77e1-58ed-a0cc-63985a4f0496"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/01da902b-2c82-5862-a845-4dd845799f6f","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/01da902b-2c82-5862-a845-4dd845799f6f"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-04-01T16:19:49.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-04-04T05:03:40.000+00:00","headline":"Buds 3 to buds 4 pro upgrade","reviewBody":"Upgraded from bud3 and absolutely loving them, great features and sound clarity, goos battery life, seamless connectivity and Noise cancellation.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"MD1992"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/fbe0ce7f-18f5-5457-86a9-6e359da72b37","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/fbe0ce7f-18f5-5457-86a9-6e359da72b37"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/0354beb8-091b-58ec-82a4-f027b7d83e46","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/0354beb8-091b-58ec-82a4-f027b7d83e46"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/08388ee7-bcf9-5ad3-8440-ae86febddc9c","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/08388ee7-bcf9-5ad3-8440-ae86febddc9c"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-05-05T09:21:48.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-05-06T03:15:12.000+00:00","headline":"Worth it","reviewBody":"I just bought these 2 days ago. They are very comfortable to wear compared to the old ones and in terms of music quality they are amazing","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Omarmakk"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/13903058-3d5f-59ab-9c71-ead6c12e66d7","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/13903058-3d5f-59ab-9c71-ead6c12e66d7"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/52ec5e96-b289-5a58-b646-cb6ced281b9e","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/52ec5e96-b289-5a58-b646-cb6ced281b9e"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/a4efb07d-8b2c-5988-a9dc-56c639dc040c","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/a4efb07d-8b2c-5988-a9dc-56c639dc040c"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-05-02T18:32:17.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-05-03T23:30:12.000+00:00","headline":"I bought it on March and im not happy at all","reviewBody":"whomever i called they can't hear me and the first sentence i heard from them your voice is too far, please remove the air buds","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":1,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Hatem Alzain"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/fc9e7ac6-d357-5e14-a938-465a32bd0cbd","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/fc9e7ac6-d357-5e14-a938-465a32bd0cbd"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/d240dc57-a817-55f5-8898-a046ee81567b","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/d240dc57-a817-55f5-8898-a046ee81567b"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/1253a5a2-5c62-5410-b059-c6dddbfb8c27","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/1253a5a2-5c62-5410-b059-c6dddbfb8c27"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-04-16T07:03:46.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-04-16T22:15:10.000+00:00","headline":"ممتازة وعملية","reviewBody":"البطارية ممتازة تجلس يوم و أحيانا يومين حسب الاستخدام، والبحث عنها من الجوال جدا سهل، وبشكل تلقائي تشبك مجرد ما تحطها بالاذن، وتفصل مجرد ما تشيلها أي صوت أو موسيقى تسمعها، لكن انتبه ممكن ترد تليفون والسماعة مش بالاذن ولكن البلوتوث لسه موصول عليها، بالنسبة لي اصغر سماعة كانت برضو كبيرة وبحتاج أشيلها واترك السماعة بدون السيليكون علشان أرتاح فيها لفترات طويلة لكن هذا بيأثر على ثباتها داخل الاذن، الصوت جدا واضح والميكرفون ممتاز، حتى لما أحط السماعات تحت الطرحة وأكلم الناس الصوت جدا واضح وما عندهم مشكلة بسماعي","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"أم أنس"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/be4413a3-4462-5c4c-b5ce-80179eab9006","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/be4413a3-4462-5c4c-b5ce-80179eab9006"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/8d7169d6-4b41-51b6-b8a9-9b33b254e999","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9zYQ/8d7169d6-4b41-51b6-b8a9-9b33b254e999"}}],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-03-26T08:33:36.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-05-05T01:35:28.000+00:00","headline":"Best noise canceling","reviewBody":"Just got my hands on these new buds and wow, the noise canceling is absolutely next-level! 🎧  Seriously, it's like stepping into my own little quiet bubble, perfect for tuning out the world.  Plus, they are so comfy, I can wear them for hours without any ear fatigue.  And the battery life?  It just keeps going and going, I barely have to think about charging them.  Feeling pretty impressed with this upgrade!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Rashed Ali"},"image":[{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/17259646-9af6-570e-a1db-d960caac683f","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/17259646-9af6-570e-a1db-d960caac683f"}},{"@type":"ImageObject","image":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ftc3VuZy1lbl9hZQ/194c9d87-507d-5134-a289-1817e625e63a","description":"normal","thumbnail":{"@type":"ImageObject","name":"https://photos-us.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86c2Ft