          <p class="buds-media-quote__text" data-copy-set="C01-008">"The Galaxy Buds4 Pro are extremely recommendable. I absolutely love the sound quality in them. The fit and the comfort are incredible. The microphones are really, really impressive. And they have pretty much every feature I would want. These are not only a jack of all trades, but also a master of quite a few as well."</p> 
