        <li class="buds-media-quote__item swiper-slide" role="listitem"> 
         <div class="buds-media-quote__content"> 
          <p class="buds-media-quote__text" data-copy-set="C01-012">"The Galaxy Buds4 Pro deliver a warm sound that's tuned for the mainstream: bass is ample, without being overpowering, vocals are clean, and the high-end gives a great impression of detail. Tool's Parabola hits hard on the chorus, but I was still able to pick out individual instruments."</p> 
