   <div class="buds-design-text"> 
    <p class="buds-design-text__description" data-copy-set="C04-02">The <strong>real metal blade</strong> defines both design and control. Finely sculpted from aluminum and perfected to create an impeccable hairline, Galaxy Buds4 Pro shines elegantly, turning heads. Finished in timeless colors, it presents a classic look that feels sophisticated yet versatile. Shaped for lasting comfort and stability, the surface that touches your ears feel naturally comfortable to provide a secure fit. From docking and charging to control, every interaction flows seamlessly through an ergonomic design.</p> 
