     <ul class="buds-faq__list" role="list"> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category4"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:best-for-me^key-features" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:best-for-me^key-features" data-keyword="key-features" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-4a6345d6-2643af3" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:best-for-me^key-features" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What are the key features of Galaxy Buds4 Pro?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-601a2814" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Galaxy Buds4 Pro delivers Hi-Fi audio with premium upgrades.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Sound: The 2-way Speaker and Dual Amp reproduces sound that's true to the original recording. Samsung Seamless Codec (SSC) supports 24-bit / 96 kHz audio for improved fidelity and stability. With Adjust to fit option, you can enjoy music anywhere through sound that adjusts to your ear shape and wearing style. Plus, the Super Clear Call lets you communicate clearly through the noise.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Design: The metal blade adds sophistication to the design, which is also upgraded for comfortable fit with an ergonomic shape and silicone ear tips. The Charging Case has a translucent cover, and is compact for portability.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> One UI: The seamless connection with Galaxy devices running the latest One UI 8.5 makes more things effortless with Galaxy Buds4 Pro. You can easily manage features from the device settings and Quick Panel without downloading a separate app.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">15</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category4"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:best-for-me^differences-pro" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:best-for-me^differences-pro" data-keyword="differences-pro" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-f779df27-d909cb9f" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:best-for-me^differences-pro" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What are the differences between Galaxy Buds4 Pro and Galaxy Buds4?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-9360a1bd" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">The main differences between Galaxy Buds4 Pro and Galaxy Bud4 are as follows.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Galaxy Buds4 Pro has an enhanced 2-way Speaker and a Dual Amplifier to reproduce Hi-Fi sound that's true to the original recording. And it comes with 3 sets of silicone ear tips in different sizes for sound delivery with less distortion. Features such as Voice Detect and Siren Detect are supported on Galaxy Buds4 Pro.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> Galaxy Buds4 produces balanced sound with a capable speaker and is optimized for everyday listening.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">13</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category1"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^in-box" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^in-box" data-keyword="in-box" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-b38ae762-7f2d987a" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^in-box" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What comes in the box with Galaxy Buds4 Pro?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-b4a04e0e" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Galaxy Buds4 Pro comes with earbuds, ear tips (3 sets: S/M/L), Charging Case and the Quick Start Guide. USB Type-C cable is not included.</p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category1"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^ear-tips" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^ear-tips" data-keyword="ear-tips" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-64d61cfe-e21845fd" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^ear-tips" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">Does Galaxy Buds4 Pro include ear tips?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-a5db26bc" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Yes, Galaxy Buds4 Pro includes 3 sets of ear tips in different sizes — small, medium and large.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">M-sized ear tips are attached to the earbuds by default.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Change the size if you need to and find the fit that's comfortable to your ears.</li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category1"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^colors" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^colors" data-keyword="colors" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-e3f73caa-c3e6d92f" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^colors" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What colors does Galaxy Buds4 Pro come in?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-3b4d7522" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description"> Galaxy Buds4 Pro comes in White and Black. We also offer a Samsung.com only color, Pink Gold, which is exclusively for customers who purchase on our site. Choose your favorite color and match it to every tune.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-7f2e7279-2b016c50">2</a></sup> </p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category1"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^wireless-charging" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^wireless-charging" data-keyword="wireless-charging" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-bb53f210-4419d74f" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^wireless-charging" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">Does the Charging Case support wireless charging?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-ac300bea" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Yes, Galaxy Buds4 Pro Charging Case can be charged wirelessly. Wireless charging pad is not included in the box and is sold separately.</p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category1"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^same-charging-case" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^same-charging-case" data-keyword="same-charging-case" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-c7a5b1e9-3d23ee6e" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^same-charging-case" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">Do Galaxy Buds4 Pro and Galaxy Buds4 use the same Charging Case?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-95b60673" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">No. The Charging Case for each Buds is shaped differently, making it incompatible between the two models.</p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category1"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^pinch-control" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^pinch-control" data-keyword="pinch-control" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-24f16cb6-ca2cd8c8" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:design^pinch-control" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">How does Pinch Control work?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-fece9d5f" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">You can use Pinch Control on Galaxy Buds4 Pro using your index finger. First, wear the earbuds and try the following actions:</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Single pinch: Pinch once to play or pause the track, answer or end a call and stop using features such as Read notifications aloud, Voice Detect and Siren Detect.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Double pinch: Pinch twice to play the next track.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Triple pinch: Pinch three times to play the previous track.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Pinch and hold: Pinch and hold to turn on the preset feature or decline a call.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Swipe: Swipe up or down using your index finger to adjust the volume.</li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category2"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^2-way-speaker" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^2-way-speaker" data-keyword="2-way-speaker" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-ca59db86-aaae180" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^2-way-speaker" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What is 2-way Speaker?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-cd400f4f" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description"> Galaxy Buds4 Pro has two speaker drivers that handle different frequency ranges — the wider woofer and the tweeter. The advanced 2-way Speaker delivers sound across the full-spectrum with more detail and less distortion. <sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-7f2e7279-2b016c50">7</a></sup> </p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category2"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^dual-amplifier" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^dual-amplifier" data-keyword="dual-amplifier" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-75af9037-f5f15406" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^dual-amplifier" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What is Dual Amplifier?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-a8d1171a" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Galaxy Buds4 Pro has two dedicated amplifiers for each speaker driver in the advanced 2-way Speaker for intricate control, minimizing interference. This separate operation makes meticulous tuning possible to produce high-quality sound.</p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category2"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^what-is-ssc-uhq" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^what-is-ssc-uhq" data-keyword="what-is-ssc-uhq" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-8cbcdb1c-2b552ca7" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^what-is-ssc-uhq" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What is Samsung Seamless Codec (SSC) Ultra High Quality Audio (UHQ) Option?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="43d08ab0-1178a978" data-di-rand="1778922042992"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description"> You can turn on SSC - UHQ option when Galaxy Buds4 Series is paired with an eligible Galaxy device. The audio is delivered in extended 24-bit bit depth and 96 kHz sampling rate. Hear Hi-Fi sound in full detail, with rich audio information.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-7f2e7279-2b016c50">8</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-7f2e7279-2b016c50">9</a></sup> </p> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category2"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^support-ssc-uhq" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^support-ssc-uhq" data-keyword="support-ssc-uhq" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-67af8c2-2b7feb6" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^support-ssc-uhq" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">Which Galaxy smartphones and Galaxy Tab support SSC - UHQ?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="fb6cedd5-9f5df7f8" data-di-rand="1778922042993"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">SSC - UHQ supports up to 24-bit / 96 kHz and is available on Galaxy smartphones and Galaxy Tab. More devices may be supported in the future.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Galaxy smartphones: Galaxy S26 Series, S25 Series, S24 Series, S23 Series, Z Fold7, Z Flip7, Z Fold6, Z Flip6, Z Fold5, Z Flip5</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> Galaxy Tab: Tab S11 Series, Tab S10 Series, Tab S9 Series with One UI 6.1.1 or above.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">9</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category2"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^super-clear-call" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^super-clear-call" data-keyword="super-clear-call" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-4aa560a1-4f366940" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:sound^super-clear-call" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What is Super Clear Call?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="fb6cedd5-61ccdace" data-di-rand="1778922042993"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">When you're on a phone call with Galaxy Buds4 Series in your ears, you can hear and be heard, loud and clear, even in noisy moments.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Galaxy Buds4 Series isolates your voice input through an advanced Deep Neural Network (DNN) technology.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> The conversation between the caller and receiver is delivered through Super Wideband (SWB) up to 16 kHz, making the call crystal clear.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">10</a>, <a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">11</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category3"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^connect" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^connect" data-keyword="connect" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-8af00a8c-9ad4a459" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^connect" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">How do I connect Galaxy Buds4 Pro to my Galaxy device?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="fb6cedd5-1e7c03de" data-di-rand="1778922042993"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Just open the Charging Case and you’re all set to connect Galaxy Buds4 Pro to your Galaxy device.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">The earbuds automatically start pairing and a popup screen will appear on the Galaxy device.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> Tap Connect and the pairing is complete.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">14</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">15</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-14" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">16</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-15" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">17</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category3"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^app" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^app" data-keyword="app" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-8e5348d3-87dbc8bd" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^app" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">Do I need a separate app to control Galaxy Buds4 Pro?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="fb6cedd5-a01b35bf" data-di-rand="1778922042993"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">If you're using Galaxy devices running on One UI 8.0 or later, you can control Galaxy Buds4 Series without downloading any additional apps. Pair your Buds with your Galaxy device instantly and enjoy your listening experience.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">On Galaxy devices running on One UI 8.0 or later, certain features can be controlled from the Quick Panel or you can manage Galaxy Buds4 Pro in more detail from your phone's device settings without downloading any additional apps.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> For Galaxy devices running on earlier versions of One UI, configurations can be found in the Galaxy Wearable app.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-26" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">28</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
        </div> 
       </div> </li> 
      <li class="buds-faq__item" role="listitem" data-category="category3"> <h3 class="buds-faq__question"> <button type="button" class="buds-faq__button" data-omni-type="microsite_contentinter" data-omni="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^interpreter" ga-ca="content click" ga-ac="accordion" ga-la="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^interpreter" data-keyword="interpreter" aria-expanded="false" data-di-id="di-id-f2643f71-9031db8d" data-media-group="interest" data-media-details="gbuds4pro:features:faq:acdn-open:galaxy-experience^interpreter" data-media-action="click"> <span class="buds-faq__text">What are the benefits of using Interpreter feature with Galaxy Buds4 Pro and Samsung Galaxy smartphone together?</span> 
         <svg class="common-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-di-res-id="fb6cedd5-c9cad881" data-di-rand="1778922042993"> 
          <use xlink:href="#icon-arrow-down" href="#icon-arrow-down"></use> 
         </svg> </button> </h3> 
       <div class="buds-faq__answer js-faq-answer" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"> 
        <div class="buds-faq__answer-inner"> 
         <p class="buds-faq__description">Galaxy AI provides swift interpretation — hear it through Galaxy Buds4 Pro and read it on your Galaxy smartphone. Keep your earbuds on, even when you're talking with a person that speaks in another language.</p> 
         <ul class="buds-faq__answer-list"> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item">Your speech is delivered to Samsung Galaxy smartphone to be interpreted and played through its speakers.</li> 
          <li class="buds-faq__answer-item"> The opponent's speech is delivered to Samsung Galaxy smartphone to be interpreted but will be played through Galaxy Buds4 Pro.<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-18" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">20</a>,<a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See Disclaimer" data-sup-tag="sup-19" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-di-id="di-id-4bbf7a29-2c9117b8">21</a></sup> </li> 
         </ul> 
